text Today, I wait at the bottom of the hill again for Tomoyo to come back from school.
text As classes end, many groups of students start travelling down the slope.
sound 6XS.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Huh? Hey, weren't you suspended or something?
text A lone male student stops in front of me.
text Judging by the color of his emblem, he's a second-year.
text @[Tomoya]
text You're talking awfully casually to me for a second-year.
sound 6XT.aac
text @[Male Student]
text It's not like we're in the same club or anything, so don't sweat such small stuff.
text @[Tomoya]
text I only told you because I figured you didn't know.
sound 6XU.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Why, thanks.
text He completely ruined the mood.
text All I wanted was to just keep waiting here, thinking of Tomoyo.
sound 6XV.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Even among us second-years, there're rumours going around about you two doing some crazy stuff.
sound 6XW.aac
text @[Male Student]
text At this point, you guys are practically celebrities.
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you trying to pick a fight?
sound 6XX.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Not at all. I just wanted to see what kind of person she was with.
text @[Tomoya]
text What? Are you interested in Tomoyo or something?
sound 6XY.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Don't get the wrong idea here. Unlike you, my tastes in women are normal.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...You bastard, you really are trying to pick a fight, aren't you?
sound 6XZ.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I'm not. Just hear me out.
sound 6Y0.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I'm not interested in her like that. I'm just curious about her.
sound 6Y1.aac
text @[Male Student]
text She really is an interesting person.
sound 6Y2.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I feel like I want to be beside her, watching over her.
text @[Tomoya]
text Isn't that the exact same thing?
sound 6Y3.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Well, you can interpret it however you want.
sound 6Y4.aac
text @[Male Student]
text However, I suggest you hold off on making the things you do too public.
sound 6Y5.aac
text @[Male Student]
text That's all I want to say.
text @[Tomoya]
text You do realize how jealous you sound, right?
sound 6Y6.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Like I said, I'm not.
sound 6Y7.aac
text @[Male Student]
text I really don't care what kind of relationship you two have.
sound 6Y8.aac
text @[Male Student]
text Just don't go bragging and spread these rumors yourself.
text Something snaps in the back of my mind.
text @[Tomoya]
text If you're trying to pick a fight, just say so!
