	fi
fi
sound 6ZI.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text So right now, you guys are already known throughout the school as a couple.
text Sunohara says that with a scornful laugh. I can only imagine how much the students must hate seeing us together.
text After all... she's with me, of all people.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH15B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 6ZJ.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Perhaps she should just withdraw her candidacy, before she's put to shame even more.
sound 6ZK.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Well, you know how she is. It seems she's not paying the rumors any attention at all.
text @[Tomoya]
text You won't know how it'll turn out until the very end, though.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH18B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH18B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 6ZL.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text You think she'll make the election?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text You think she's going to lose?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH15B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 6ZM.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Yeah.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH13B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH13B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 6ZN.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text But this is a good thing for you, isn't it?
sound 6ZO.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text You know your relationship wouldn't last very long if she became the student council president.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, I guess...
sound 6ZP.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text It's not like she doesn't want to be with you, either, so don't you think Tomoyo would be fine with pulling out?
text @[Tomoya]
text Maybe so...
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text That is indeed what I should be wishing for.
text Even so, what are these complicated feelings welling up inside me?
text ......
text So many things have happened so quickly one after another lately, I guess I just can't sort out my feelings.
text But given enough time, I'm sure these feelings will resolve themselves.
text Right now, I think I should be able to just be glad about all of this.
text From the very beginning, I wasn't the kind of guy who would feel remorse over things like this.
text My last year.
text I will spend this year with Tomoyo at this school.
text Because of all that's happened, that wish of mine will be granted... so I should just be glad.
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s24
fi
goto 31
